{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_08",
  "title": "大夢",
  "storyCode": "WR-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5a8a29f43471877347b4f9962d45a09f1e3f54b5ce0cc5d81411ae66a447d596",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "......嘎啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "墨魎，墨，魎，多好的名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "嵯峨那個孩子，是個天生慧根的好苗子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "一次又一次保護著根本不會受損的器物，那是不是總會有一次，他們放棄了心中的那份正義，對這種徒勞的道德感到麻木呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "也許會吧。如果瓷器能夠輕鬆恢復原狀，砸碎它就不會感到心疼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "不，你甚至會愛上砸碎它的感覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "......嘎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "可是，又何必做這麼絕呢......人性是經不起考驗的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "......嘎唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "你看著這裡嗎？夕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "你這麼壞心眼......可要原諒我接下來的小心思哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "——呼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "二位恩人，總算解決啦......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "可真不是我潑冷水，繼續陪著這些怪物耗下去，咱們何日才能找到離開這裡的線索？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嵯峨說，她會想辦法的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "那咱們就在這日復一日地對付墨魎？這也不是什麼好事吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......沒關係，不費勁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "就當鑽研自己的法術了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "——小炎熔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嗯？怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "說呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......你剛才使用的源石技藝，稍微有點危險了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......我......？啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "看到了？你燒毀了不少鋪子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "還有你啊，小烏有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "你剛才是不是有刻意對那隻衝向鎮子的小墨魎視而不見？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "我那不是相信恩人一定會處理好的嘛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "不，你想的是，“萬一出了什麼差錯，第二天也會變回原樣的”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "不......我不會否認......就算我心裡有數，但......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "今天是第七天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我不是強人所難，守衛沒有意義的目標，日復一日，遲早是會變成這樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "別忘了在雷姆必拓的那個月......那是場血淋淋的教訓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "戰鬥是會折磨人心的，我們該時刻警醒一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "克洛絲......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "抱歉......小炎熔，你知道的，我一直......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "好了，我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我們不會有事的，我們會安安穩穩離開這裡，安安穩穩回到羅德島。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "好~回去之後請我喝哥倫比亞咖啡哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嵯峨還在房間裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "我今天出門前去看過一眼，大師已經枯坐整整七天啦......恩人呐，你說要真不吃不喝死在這畫裡......會真死了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "不知道。當時嵯峨只說“交給我吧”，然後二話不說就關門不出了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "最瞭解現在情況的人就是嵯峨，我們也別無選擇，或者你想像她一樣，去其他畫卷遊覽一番？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "不不不不，免了免了。我可不如大師那麼堅定，一個不留神，就徹底出不來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......在嵯峨那邊有什麼結果前，我們也沒什麼能為她做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "原來你們在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "黎小姐？你來做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "來提醒你們，莫要偏離本心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "“假作真時真亦假，無為有處有還無”，我過去這麼勸過嵯峨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "對了，她人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嵯峨已經在房間裡冥想許多日了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......啊，她想醒去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "很少有人能主動從畫卷中醒去，不，是從來沒有人能夠做到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "不過......說不定呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "炎熔小姐，你聽說過，“爆竹”這種東西嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "在大炎，這是一種古老的民俗，當然，起源於——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "——驅逐古老的怪物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "哎呀......炎熔小姐是異鄉出身的薩卡茲吧？竟然還會對大炎傳統有研究？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......不是，是我那個朋友......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "啊。我想起來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你可以別想起來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "是《洪爐示歲》裡的劇情吧？說年害怕爆竹，最後的玄極巨兵也是用護城炮——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "——啊啊啊，我不要聽！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "黎小姐！爆竹和現在的情況有什麼聯繫嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "嗯？啊......我想，那些墨魎其實也是懼怕爆竹的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "只要把爆竹懸在城鎮入口，那些墨魎，自然就不敢靠近啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "真的！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "哎喲，那可太方便啦，總算不用日復一日守在這了，我腰都酸啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "那事不宜遲，咱們趕緊去鎮上集市瞧瞧——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "集市裡，自然是沒有這種東西的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "——我想也是啊。那怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "總有辦法的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "爆竹，為什麼要叫爆竹？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......是因為最早的大炎子民，為了紀念先帝的豐功偉績，以火燒竹子的方法，紀念那場曠世大戰......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "你知道的還挺多嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "哈哈，沒事看看雜書，雜書......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "那就行了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "給它們準備一個驚喜吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "就這棵，不是挺好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "欸......我看這棵長得還挺好看的，有點可惜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "反正明天會再長出來的啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "您倒是一點也不客氣啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我來了，這些夠不夠？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "越多越好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "煮傘先生也真是好說話，就這麼把竹子白送給我們啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "若是過意不去，回頭我去向他道聲謝就是。我那當鋪，永遠不會有人贖東西，乾脆就送了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "這不合適吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "反正明天就會變回原樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "唔，我是見過柴火劈哩啪啦的樣子，竹子會更響嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "聽說雨後濕竹更加響亮，不過，罷了，這裡可不會下雨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "對，就這樣......壘成一個土灶......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "火的話——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "——我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......可控制點火候啊，這裡頭有點學問的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我、我試試看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "恩人！它們來啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "現在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "唔——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎、嘎啊——！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "成功了！它們愣住了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎——！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "它們跑了？真的被嚇跑了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......居然真的有效？這是為什麼......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "這就要問年——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "text": "......年？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
